Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.42,0:00:14.87,Default,SETSU,0,0,0,,Do you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.20,0:00:16.57,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,{\i1}Setsu...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.57,0:00:18.30,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,{\i1}I guess I looped again.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.83,0:00:21.10,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.10,0:00:21.86,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.69,0:00:23.92,Default,SETSU,0,0,0,,Is something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.52,0:00:25.93,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Huh? Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.32,0:00:28.21,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Huh? Huh?! Hm?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.70,0:00:30.51,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.51,0:00:32.22,Default,SETSU,0,0,0,,Are you still hurting somewhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.49,0:00:34.35,Default,SETSU,0,0,0,,Have your wounds not healed completely?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.35,0:00:36.05,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,No, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.05,0:00:39.21,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,I'm... a girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.90,0:00:42.69,Default,SETSU,0,0,0,,Looks like your memories \Nare still in disarray.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.36,0:00:45.84,Default,SETSU,0,0,0,,Yes, you're a woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.84,0:00:47.38,Default,SETSU,0,0,0,,Your name is Yuri.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.54,0:02:26.46,Default,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}EPISODE 10: CITIZEN SLIME
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.51,0:02:23.58,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is me...?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.58,0:02:25.50,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm a woman...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.50,0:02:28.33,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,{\i1}Not only can I apparently turn into \Na Gnosia depending on the loop,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.33,0:02:30.34,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,{\i1}even something like this is possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.30,0:02:32.37,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.85,0:02:34.17,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Er, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.18,0:02:40.14,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,So, like, I got hurt and took a nap \Nin that capsule, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.14,0:02:44.87,Default,SETSU,0,0,0,,Yes. I believe that some of your memories \Nmay have been compromised by the shock.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.66,0:02:49.05,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,{\i1}So nothing's really changed \Nother than my gender.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.05,0:02:51.03,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,{\i1}Then why...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.25,0:02:55.16,Default,SETSU,0,0,0,,Yuri?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.70,0:03:03.47,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,Ooh, we've been waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.47,0:03:06.54,Default,SETSU,0,0,0,,Sorry. Now we're all here, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.54,0:03:07.75,Default,STELLA,0,0,0,,Actually...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.20,0:03:10.88,Default,REMNAN,0,0,0,,Sha-ming isn't here yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.31,0:03:16.46,Default,CHIPIE,0,0,0,,{\an8}I did talk to him before heading here. \NHe just said to do whatever we want.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.46,0:03:18.88,Default,SETSU,0,0,0,,{\an8}And that's not going to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.88,0:03:20.53,Default,CHIPIE,0,0,0,,{\an8}Say that to him, not me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.81,0:03:23.96,Default,SHIGEMICHI,0,0,0,,So can someone tell me \Nhow many Gnosia there are?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.96,0:03:24.84,Default,LEVI,0,0,0,,{\i1}Affirmative.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.84,0:03:28.22,Default,LEVI,0,0,0,,{\i1}Two Gnosia have been detected on board.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.22,0:03:31.98,Default,LEVI,0,0,0,,{\i1}There is also one Engineer and one Doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.37,0:03:37.86,Default,LEVI,0,0,0,,{\i1}Furthermore, Racio and Shigemichi remained \Non board when this ship docked at Liu-An,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.86,0:03:40.45,Default,LEVI,0,0,0,,{\i1}and are thus confirmed to be human.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.15,0:03:45.80,Default,JONAS,0,0,0,,Hm... If there remains a possibility \Nthat Sha-ming is a Gnosia,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.80,0:03:48.25,Default,JONAS,0,0,0,,why not freeze him and see how that turns out?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.25,0:03:50.08,Default,JONAS,0,0,0,,Let us cast the die of fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.08,0:03:52.68,Default,OTOME,0,0,0,,I think that's a bit reckless.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.68,0:03:57.08,Default,RACIO,0,0,0,,We also can't discount the possibility that \Nhe is the one with Engineer credentials.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.03,0:03:59.84,Default,OTOME,0,0,0,,{\an8}You're so nice, Racio.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.34,0:04:04.29,Default,RACIO,0,0,0,,I didn't say it out of kindness. I was simply \Nconsidering the entire probability space.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.29,0:04:06.12,Default,COMET,0,0,0,,So what're we gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.12,0:04:08.56,Default,YURIKO,0,0,0,,Our meetings are limited.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.56,0:04:09.95,Default,YURIKO,0,0,0,,Hurry up and decide.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.37,0:04:14.58,Default,SETSU,0,0,0,,I really do think that we should \Nall be here for the meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.58,0:04:15.73,Default,SETSU,0,0,0,,What do you think, Yuri?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.73,0:04:16.66,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.96,0:04:19.27,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,I... I mean, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.27,0:04:21.93,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,I, like, totally agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.26,0:04:27.29,Default,SHIGEMICHI,0,0,0,,Guess we're delaying the \Nmeeting an hour, meow.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.29,0:04:28.89,Default,CHIPIE,0,0,0,,I'm gonna go for a light jog.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.25,0:04:33.28,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,{\i1}Everything seems to be the same, \Nother than me being a woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.28,0:04:35.71,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,{\i1}But there has to be something...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.71,0:04:37.21,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,{\i1}I guess I should talk to someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.62,0:04:40.85,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,{\i1}I think Setsu is already heading over \Nto try and convince Sha-ming,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.86,0:04:40.45,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,{\an8}Woohoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.13,0:04:44.38,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,{\i1}and I don't know for sure \Nthat they're not a Gnosia.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.38,0:04:45.67,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,{\i1}Which leaves...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.62,0:04:47.72,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,{\i1}I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.72,0:04:50.03,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,{\i1}Those on Guard Duty are confirmed human.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.44,0:04:51.92,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,{\i1}I can talk to those two.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.38,0:04:54.68,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Where's Racio?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.68,0:04:58.06,Default,JONAS,0,0,0,,Who knows? I believe they left first.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.45,0:04:59.80,Default,SHIGEMICHI,0,0,0,,Hm? What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.80,0:05:01.21,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Shigemichi...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.93,0:05:03.63,Default,SHIGEMICHI,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.63,0:05:05.84,Default,SHIGEMICHI,0,0,0,,Something troublin' you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.19,0:05:09.13,Default,SHIGEMICHI,0,0,0,,I'm always happy to lend an ear \Nto a cutie-pie like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.50,0:05:13.33,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,N-No, it's nothing... Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.12,0:05:20.79,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,{\i1}Do guys always look this stupid \Nfrom a woman's point of view?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.79,0:05:22.10,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,{\i1}I need to be more careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.26,0:05:28.99,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,That face... I guess you do remember, Papa.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.45,0:05:30.51,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,"Papa"?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.19,0:05:34.06,Default,REMNAN,0,0,0,,No... No! Why...?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.06,0:05:37.16,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,Why? You know why.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.81,0:05:41.00,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,It's because I love you, Remmy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.57,0:05:43.75,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,SQ...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.32,0:05:46.85,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,Ah, Yuri! Hi, hi!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.28,0:05:48.31,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.75,0:05:51.63,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Er... I was just wondering where Racio was.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.63,0:05:52.99,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,Racio?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.99,0:05:54.01,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,Ah...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.87,0:05:57.00,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,Lemme give you a special guided tour!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.73,0:06:00.01,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.01,0:06:01.97,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Er, what about Remnan?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.43,0:06:04.33,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,Oh, he's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.33,0:06:06.83,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,Remmy's always like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.69,0:06:09.81,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.26,0:06:11.32,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.32,0:06:14.77,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,Aren't you curious what \Ntheir body looks like, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.77,0:06:15.77,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.77,0:06:19.28,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,What? N-No! That's not...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.28,0:06:23.66,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,Now, now, no need to be modest. \NI'll have a peek with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.99,0:06:25.04,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.99,0:06:26.76,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,That's not it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.76,0:06:28.51,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,That's not what I...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.52,0:06:30.58,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,{\an8}Wh-Wh-Wh-Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.14,0:06:30.34,Default,SQ,0,0,0,,Kitty punch!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.58,0:06:31.71,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.71,0:06:33.51,Default,RACIO,0,0,0,,What are you fools doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.98,0:06:35.81,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.30,0:06:37.44,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Racio...?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.89,0:06:41.37,Default,RACIO,0,0,0,,Voyeurism is a crime, you know. \NRegardless of the genders involved.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.37,0:06:43.30,Default,RACIO,0,0,0,,Do you want to get thrown out?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.30,0:06:46.30,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,No, that's not it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.30,0:06:48.51,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,I just wanted to talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.31,0:06:55.21,Default,RACIO,0,0,0,,I see. So in the course of your looping, \Nyou ended up becoming a woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.21,0:06:56.10,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.61,0:06:57.95,Default,RACIO,0,0,0,,{\an8}And?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.95,0:06:59.80,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,{\an8}And? Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.89,0:07:04.22,Default,RACIO,0,0,0,,I can't imagine why so many stubbornly \Ninsist on clinging to notions of gender.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.22,0:07:08.86,Default,RACIO,0,0,0,,Once you free yourself of that burden, \Nyou understand how inconsequential it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.86,0:07:11.62,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,You may be right, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.62,0:07:12.83,Default,RACIO,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.83,0:07:15.91,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,I think I got a bit off track.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.61,0:07:19.70,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,{\an8}I'm more curious about \N{\i1}why{\i0} this is happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.70,0:07:24.72,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,On the previous loop, I was a \NGnosia, and I... I mean, like...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.72,0:07:27.88,Default,RACIO,0,0,0,,Hmph. You don't even understand that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.88,0:07:30.37,Default,RACIO,0,0,0,,Very well. Then let me ask you a question.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.37,0:07:31.16,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.65,0:07:33.57,Default,RACIO,0,0,0,,Why are the loops occurring?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.89,0:07:36.39,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,{\an8}Because... of the Silver Key.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.39,0:07:39.14,Default,RACIO,0,0,0,,Precisely. Next question.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.14,0:07:42.25,Default,RACIO,0,0,0,,Why does the Silver Key make you loop?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.79,0:07:45.36,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,To gather knowledge and \Ninformation on humans...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.36,0:07:46.45,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.45,0:07:49.11,Default,RACIO,0,0,0,,Did you finally figure it out?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.43,0:07:51.76,Default,RACIO,0,0,0,,The Silver Key is a living organism.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.76,0:07:55.90,Default,RACIO,0,0,0,,That knowledge and information is \Nthe sustenance it needs to survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.90,0:07:58.91,Default,RACIO,0,0,0,,It stands to reason that it would \Ninstinctively know where to find more.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.51,0:08:03.03,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,So it wasn't a coincidence that \NI ended up like this on this loop.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.03,0:08:06.69,Default,RACIO,0,0,0,,I'm sure there is information and \Nknowledge to gain from the world line
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.69,0:08:08.93,Default,RACIO,0,0,0,,that the Silver Key has sent you to.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.93,0:08:12.25,Default,RACIO,0,0,0,,And that information is something \Nyou can only obtain in that form.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.25,0:08:16.18,Default,RACIO,0,0,0,,That's why you ended up that way. \NIsn't it obvious?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.49,0:08:17.78,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Racio...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.69,0:08:20.48,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Thanks, Racio.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.48,0:08:21.37,Default,RACIO,0,0,0,,Hmph.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.84,0:08:27.44,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,{\i1}So I probably ended up as a Gnosia last time \Nto gain more knowledge of Comet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.97,0:08:30.41,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,{\i1}What leads do I have this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.17,0:08:41.28,Default,JONAS,0,0,0,,Hm...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.64,0:08:44.20,Default,JONAS,0,0,0,,So you want to hear about old Jonas.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.20,0:08:48.64,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Yes. I heard that you were a crew \Nmember on a famous ship in the past,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.64,0:08:50.58,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,so I, like, wanted to ask you about that...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.58,0:08:53.19,Default,SHIGEMICHI,0,0,0,,Man, I lost!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.19,0:08:55.33,Default,JONAS,0,0,0,,Well, given that our match has just ended,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.33,0:08:59.23,Default,JONAS,0,0,0,,I would be more than happy to fulfill \Na request from a beautiful lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.09,0:09:01.73,Default,JONAS,0,0,0,,{\i1}Where shall I begin?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.73,0:09:03.49,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yes, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.49,0:09:09.87,Default,JONAS,0,0,0,,{\i1}Well, then, I guess I can start with \Nhow I ended up exploring space.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.87,0:09:14.28,Default,JONAS,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}Stella, fetch me some coffee that's black as \Na demon's blood and hot as the fires of hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.28,0:09:15.67,Default,STELLA,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}As you wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.90,0:09:20.46,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,{\i1}Uh-oh. I get the feeling I'm going \Nto be here for a really long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.19,0:09:22.59,Default,JONAS,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.59,0:09:25.31,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Um... K-Kukrushka...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.31,0:09:28.35,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Could you tell me about Kukrushka?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.67,0:09:29.86,Default,JONAS,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.21,0:09:34.92,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Er, well... I've just always thought... \Nshe's really beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.92,0:09:38.27,Default,JONAS,0,0,0,,Why do you know about Kukrushka?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.27,0:09:40.49,Default,JONAS,0,0,0,,I don't recall ever letting you meet her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.78,0:09:41.61,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.61,0:09:46.61,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oh, right. Crap! I guess I haven't \Nmet Kukrushka on this loop!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.96,0:09:48.49,Default,JONAS,0,0,0,,Did you go to the storage?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.04,0:09:50.52,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Storage?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.51,0:09:53.54,Default,JONAS,0,0,0,,{\i1}I have nothing more to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.54,0:09:55.54,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Oh, Jonas...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.60,0:10:00.85,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Setsu.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.56,0:10:02.96,Default,SHIGEMICHI,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.96,0:10:06.35,Default,SETSU,0,0,0,,Well, it's taking some time to \Nconvince Sha-ming to come out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.35,0:10:11.06,Default,SETSU,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but I'd like to delay \Nthe meeting one more hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.58,0:10:15.89,Default,SETSU,0,0,0,,{\i1}Sha-ming.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.89,0:10:20.14,Default,SHA-MING,0,0,0,,{\i1}Seriously, I already told you people \Nto just do whatever you gotta.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.04,0:10:22.28,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Sha-ming...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.87,0:10:28.22,Default,SHA-MING,0,0,0,,Like I said, you wanna ask me for somethin', \Nyou gotta treat me to a hot kiss first.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.60,0:10:31.64,Default,SETSU,0,0,0,,Sha-ming. How many times must \NI tell you that I'm not a woman?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.64,0:10:34.67,Default,SHA-MING,0,0,0,,Like I said, that don't matter to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.67,0:10:37.64,Default,SHA-MING,0,0,0,,{\i1}If you got a problem, just freeze me already.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.64,0:10:38.75,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,{\i1}I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.69,0:10:40.75,Default,SETSU,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.75,0:10:41.83,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Sha-ming...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.27,0:10:45.80,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,How about me—I mean, like, \Nwanna go with me instead?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.80,0:10:47.18,Default,SHA-MING,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.18,0:10:49.95,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'll fulfill your request.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.95,0:10:52.67,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,{\i1}But in exchange, I'd like for you \Nto attend the meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.21,0:10:55.54,Default,SETSU,0,0,0,,Yuri... What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.54,0:10:56.55,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.49,0:10:59.39,Default,SHA-MING,0,0,0,,{\i1}Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.39,0:11:01.57,Default,SHA-MING,0,0,0,,You got a few screws loose?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.92,0:11:04.88,Default,SHA-MING,0,0,0,,I said I wanted a kiss. Tongue and all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.88,0:11:06.61,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.99,0:11:09.24,Default,SHA-MING,0,0,0,,Just so y'know, I might get a little rough.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.24,0:11:12.62,Default,SHA-MING,0,0,0,,And dependin' on how it goes, \NI might not stop at a kiss.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.69,0:11:14.92,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,{\i1}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.92,0:11:16.05,Default,SETSU,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yuri!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.45,0:11:21.70,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,{\i1}Sha-ming... You never had any \Nintention of kissing anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.05,0:11:25.12,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,{\i1}You only tell Setsu that \Nknowing they won't be able to
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.12,0:11:27.87,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,{\i1}and that they'll be forced to \Nsend you into cold sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.33,0:11:29.44,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,{\i1}Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.04,0:11:32.81,Default,SHA-MING,0,0,0,,Heh. Think ya got it all figured out, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.81,0:11:36.42,Default,SHA-MING,0,0,0,,In the end, I only care about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.42,0:11:38.29,Default,SHA-MING,0,0,0,,{\i1}Not like that military cadet
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.29,0:11:41.80,Default,SHA-MING,0,0,0,,{\i1}who keeps talkin' bullshit about \Ndoin' stuff for the greater good.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.50,0:11:45.85,Default,SHA-MING,0,0,0,,Come on in.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.85,0:11:48.95,Default,SHA-MING,0,0,0,,I'll make you regret underestimatin' me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.42,0:11:51.11,Default,SETSU,0,0,0,,I'll go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.56,0:11:54.99,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,You go back to everyone else, Setsu.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.72,0:12:07.21,Default,SHA-MING,0,0,0,,Wow, you actually came in.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.47,0:12:09.77,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,I told you. I'm serious about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.23,0:12:12.50,Default,SHA-MING,0,0,0,,All right. Well, get strippin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.50,0:12:16.31,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Sha-ming. You're a Gnosia, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.31,0:12:17.47,Default,SHA-MING,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.47,0:12:22.49,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,You're a Gnosia, but you don't want \Nto deceive everyone by lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.49,0:12:26.36,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,But you also don't want to betray the other \NGnosia, so you don't know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.26,0:12:28.43,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Am I wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.02,0:12:31.56,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,You can tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.44,0:12:35.47,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Sha-ming.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.79,0:12:42.34,Default,SHA-MING,0,0,0,,You promised me a kiss, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.79,0:12:47.55,Default,SHA-MING,0,0,0,,What? Did you think I wasn't \Nserious about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.55,0:12:50.98,Default,SHA-MING,0,0,0,,I told you. I can be a bit rough.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.98,0:12:52.57,Default,SHA-MING,0,0,0,,Understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.57,0:12:53.99,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,{\i1}Believe in him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.98,0:12:56.97,Default,SHA-MING,0,0,0,,Could we eliminate Otome?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.31,0:12:59.80,Default,SHA-MING,0,0,0,,I wonder what's crueler in the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.80,0:13:03.76,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,{\i1}Sha-ming isn't the kind of person \Nwho'd go through with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.09,0:13:09.06,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,{\i1}He's just scared of people finding out \Nhow he really feels.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.06,0:13:13.56,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,{\i1}So he puts up a smokescreen \Nby having everyone hate him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.56,0:13:15.37,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,{\i1}In order to get through to him...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.52,0:13:18.66,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Turn off the lights.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.60,0:13:21.91,Default,SHA-MING,0,0,0,,How long are you gonna keep actin' tough?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.71,0:13:23.85,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Turn them off.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.61,0:13:26.96,Default,SHA-MING,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.96,0:13:30.10,Default,SHA-MING,0,0,0,,If you're gonna insist that much, \NI'll make you regret it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.10,0:13:32.92,Default,SHA-MING,0,0,0,,I'll make you regret ever thinkin' \Nyou could trust a guy like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.70,0:13:44.72,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,{\i1}Believe in him... Believe in him...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.98,0:13:49.07,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,{\i1}Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.06,0:13:54.05,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,{\i1}Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.72,0:13:57.73,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,{\i1}Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.88,0:13:59.84,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,{\i1}No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.99,0:14:02.82,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,{\i1}No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.94,0:14:06.02,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,{\i1}No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.73,0:14:10.99,Default,SHA-MING,0,0,0,,Don't cry, jeez.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.99,0:14:12.17,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.23,0:14:16.30,Default,SHA-MING,0,0,0,,Don't try to act so tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.19,0:14:21.17,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,{\i1}My heart won't stop racing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.12,0:14:24.29,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}I didn't realize how scary that would be.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.10,0:14:30.20,Default,SHA-MING,0,0,0,,Huh? What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.20,0:14:33.11,Default,LEVI,0,0,0,,{\i1}Emergency. Emergency.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.59,0:14:36.21,Default,LEVI,0,0,0,,{\i1}All crew, please seek shelter.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.21,0:14:39.48,Default,LEVI,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\an8}I repeat. Emergency.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.21,0:14:37.24,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Setsu?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.49,0:14:52.26,Default,SHA-MING,0,0,0,,What the hell? There's no one here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.26,0:14:54.47,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,No one's in the main control room, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.47,0:14:55.50,Default,REMNAN,0,0,0,,Stay away!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.17,0:14:57.82,Default,REMNAN,0,0,0,,Stay away!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.18,0:14:59.39,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Remnan?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.28,0:15:05.26,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Remnan!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.86,0:15:08.44,Default,REMNAN,0,0,0,,N-No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.26,0:15:11.77,Default,REMNAN,0,0,0,,Y-Yuri... Help...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.40,0:15:13.65,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Remnan...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.65,0:15:14.49,Default,SHA-MING,0,0,0,,We need to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.49,0:15:15.35,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.35,0:15:18.36,Default,SHA-MING,0,0,0,,He's already half-eaten! \NThere's no savin' him now!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.73,0:15:19.86,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.65,0:15:23.12,Default,SHA-MING,0,0,0,,Wake up! We're gettin' outta here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.33,0:15:26.42,Default,SHA-MING,0,0,0,,Oh, hey, Shigemichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.71,0:15:28.25,Default,SHA-MING,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.75,0:15:29.65,Default,SHIGEMICHI,0,0,0,,Guh...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.24,0:15:31.31,Default,SHA-MING,0,0,0,,"Guh"?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.14,0:15:38.21,Default,SHA-MING,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.84,0:15:41.95,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,What? What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.95,0:15:43.96,Default,SHA-MING,0,0,0,,How the hell would I know?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.96,0:15:46.03,Default,SHA-MING,0,0,0,,For now, let's just head downstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.46,0:15:48.97,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,{\i1}Is it Kukrushka? No, it can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.97,0:15:51.94,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,{\i1}But the thing that was consuming Remnan...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.49,0:15:59.61,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Setsu...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.40,0:16:01.52,Default,SETSU,0,0,0,,Yuri.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.11,0:16:04.58,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.58,0:16:05.93,Default,SETSU,0,0,0,,I knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.93,0:16:06.87,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.87,0:16:11.39,Default,SETSU,0,0,0,,I previously experienced a world line \Nwhere Kukrushka killed everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.99,0:16:16.19,Default,SETSU,0,0,0,,So I've been monitoring \NJonas' actions on every loop,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.19,0:16:18.20,Default,SETSU,0,0,0,,and I discovered something in storage.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.81,0:16:20.24,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Kukrushka?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.21,0:16:23.66,Default,SHA-MING,0,0,0,,Wh-What the hell is this? A dead body?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.66,0:16:26.22,Default,SETSU,0,0,0,,No... This is a doll.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.22,0:16:28.15,Default,SHA-MING,0,0,0,,Huh? A doll?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.15,0:16:29.89,Default,SETSU,0,0,0,,Yeah. There's no doubt about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.89,0:16:32.34,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Then the one who attacked everyone...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.25,0:16:35.29,Default,STELLA,0,0,0,,Everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.85,0:16:37.38,Default,STELLA,0,0,0,,That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.93,0:16:41.13,Default,SETSU,0,0,0,,Stella, could you tell us what this is?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.63,0:16:45.49,Default,STELLA,0,0,0,,This is a doll that is very precious to Jonas.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.91,0:16:49.91,Default,STELLA,0,0,0,,She apparently resembles \Nhis late beloved, Arya.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.91,0:16:50.94,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Arya?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.29,0:16:52.86,Default,SETSU,0,0,0,,Can the doll move?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.86,0:16:57.68,Default,STELLA,0,0,0,,No. But there was also another doll, \Nand that one could move.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.93,0:17:00.47,Default,STELLA,0,0,0,,She was accompanying Jonas,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.47,0:17:03.91,Default,STELLA,0,0,0,,but when we were escaping Liu-An, \Nshe didn't make it to the ship in time...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.91,0:17:05.04,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,{\i1}I see now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.43,0:17:10.03,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,{\i1}So when she doesn't make it onto the ship, \Nonly this inanimate doll is on board.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.48,0:17:14.57,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,{\i1}But when she does...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.85,0:17:21.81,Default,STELLA,0,0,0,,More importantly, you need to take shelter.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.81,0:17:24.13,Default,STELLA,0,0,0,,There is currently a slime mold \Nmoving through the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.13,0:17:25.41,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,A slime mold?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.80,0:17:30.91,Default,STELLA,0,0,0,,Comet accidentally entered \Nan active cold sleep capsule.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.33,0:17:33.85,Default,STELLA,0,0,0,,Jonas got her out immediately,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.34,0:17:38.78,Default,STELLA,0,0,0,,but the slime mold, seemingly under the \Nmistaken belief that its host had died...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.22,0:17:43.02,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Comet's slime mold is looking for a new host?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.02,0:17:44.14,Default,STELLA,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.14,0:17:48.36,Default,STELLA,0,0,0,,But there isn't anyone on this \Nship that can coexist with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.19,0:17:50.27,Default,SETSU,0,0,0,,Yuri!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.27,0:17:51.40,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Setsu.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.40,0:17:52.38,Default,SETSU,0,0,0,,Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.67,0:17:55.75,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Setsu!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.30,0:17:57.93,Default,SETSU,0,0,0,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.04,0:18:01.25,Default,SETSU,0,0,0,,You do what you need to, Yuri.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.08,0:18:03.45,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Setsu...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.05,0:18:22.23,Default,STELLA,0,0,0,,Both of you, please get \Ninto this medical pod.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.23,0:18:27.64,Default,STELLA,0,0,0,,Once you are inside, I will expel all of the \Nair within the ship and kill the slime mold.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.05,0:18:29.39,Default,SHA-MING,0,0,0,,Wait, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.39,0:18:31.34,Default,SHA-MING,0,0,0,,What about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.34,0:18:33.25,Default,STELLA,0,0,0,,Please do not worry about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.25,0:18:34.90,Default,STELLA,0,0,0,,I will be all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.41,0:18:37.30,Default,STELLA,0,0,0,,Please believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.30,0:18:38.15,Default,STELLA,0,0,0,,Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.61,0:18:40.08,Default,SHA-MING,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.60,0:18:42.06,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Let's get in, Sha-ming.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.06,0:18:43.23,Default,SHA-MING,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.23,0:18:44.95,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Just hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.55,0:18:46.91,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Sha-ming.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.39,0:18:49.00,Default,SHA-MING,0,0,0,,Hey, Stella.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.00,0:18:53.34,Default,SHA-MING,0,0,0,,When you turn the air back on, \Ncan you wake up Yuri only?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.34,0:18:56.17,Default,STELLA,0,0,0,,Huh? Well, that is possible, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.17,0:18:59.10,Default,SHA-MING,0,0,0,,So, yeah. I'll be countin' on ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.76,0:19:06.69,Default,SHA-MING,0,0,0,,You don't wanna be dealin' with some Gnosia \Non top of everythin' else, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.08,0:19:08.26,Default,SHA-MING,0,0,0,,Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.10,0:19:11.43,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,{\i1}Sha-ming...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.10,0:19:13.76,Default,STELLA,0,0,0,,Sha-ming...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.30,0:19:23.74,Default,SHA-MING,0,0,0,,Sorry. It's a bit up close and personal in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.05,0:19:25.94,Default,SHA-MING,0,0,0,,You don't really need to worry, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.59,0:19:30.61,Default,SHA-MING,0,0,0,,Even I wouldn't try somethin' \Nfunny in this situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.09,0:19:33.47,Default,SHA-MING,0,0,0,,Though I'm probably not very convincin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.37,0:19:38.69,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,I knew it. It's just like I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.69,0:19:39.82,Default,SHA-MING,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.16,0:19:44.40,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,I've looped many times... \Nthrough many world lines.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.86,0:19:48.53,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,That's why I know the various sides of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.53,0:19:50.97,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,The side of you that feels bad for Otome...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.97,0:19:52.84,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,The side of you that cares for everyone...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.30,0:19:57.14,Default,SHA-MING,0,0,0,,I don't buy that kinda thing. Never have.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.14,0:20:01.86,Default,SHA-MING,0,0,0,,Anybody who tries to sweet-talk you \Nnever has good intentions in mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.31,0:20:03.59,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Thanks...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.63,0:20:06.55,Default,SHA-MING,0,0,0,,It's not what you think.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.35,0:20:08.75,Default,SHA-MING,0,0,0,,I grew up
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.75,0:20:14.26,Default,SHA-MING,0,0,0,,on a shitty little planet out in the sticks \Nsurrounded by intellectualized bonobos.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.57,0:20:16.89,Default,SHA-MING,0,0,0,,They were all super smart and strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.89,0:20:19.61,Default,SHA-MING,0,0,0,,And most importantly, \Nthey were all really good guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.49,0:20:23.82,Default,SHA-MING,0,0,0,,But they pissed off some \Nimportant asshole somewhere...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.46,0:20:27.21,Default,SHA-MING,0,0,0,,and they were all disposed of.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.07,0:20:31.08,Default,SHA-MING,0,0,0,,I couldn't do a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.84,0:20:35.40,Default,SHA-MING,0,0,0,,All I could do was blame myself... \Nand you can see how I ended up.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.16,0:20:40.49,Default,SHA-MING,0,0,0,,A shitty guy livin' in a shitty world.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.14,0:20:42.76,Default,SHA-MING,0,0,0,,{\an8}Everythin' sucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.49,0:20:47.52,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Even so, I know there's a future out there \Nsomewhere where you can keep smiling.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.43,0:20:50.45,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,I believe in that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.20,0:20:52.93,Default,SHA-MING,0,0,0,,Didn't I just tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.93,0:20:56.73,Default,SHA-MING,0,0,0,,I hate those kinds of fickle lies that \Nonly mean something at that moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.73,0:20:58.22,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,It's not a lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.62,0:21:01.98,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,It's not a lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.26,0:21:07.94,Default,SHA-MING,0,0,0,,Man, you're so warm. \NWhat are you, an angel?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.66,0:21:13.20,Default,SHA-MING,0,0,0,,We were just in hell bein' \Nchased by some crappy slime,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.25,0:21:17.33,Default,SHA-MING,0,0,0,,but all of a sudden, I'm in heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.98,0:21:21.30,Default,SHA-MING,0,0,0,,Seriously. This is all your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.60,0:21:24.09,Default,SHA-MING,0,0,0,,My angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.90,0:21:38.31,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Did I loop...?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.31,0:21:39.41,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.41,0:21:40.88,Default,SHA-MING,0,0,0,,Man, it's hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.36,0:21:45.41,Default,JONAS,0,0,0,,Well, well. Look who we have here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.41,0:21:48.89,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,Jonas...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.89,0:21:51.09,Default,SHA-MING,0,0,0,,What the hell is up with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.43,0:21:56.67,Default,STELLA,0,0,0,,Jonas realized that the slime \Nmold was weak against heat.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.05,0:22:01.36,Default,JONAS,0,0,0,,So we raised the temperature in the ship \Nexponentially and filled it with steam.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.70,0:22:05.60,Default,JONAS,0,0,0,,And thus, the ship staged \Na stellar sauna... of sorts.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.26,0:22:08.40,Default,JONAS,0,0,0,,Would you two like to join us?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.90,0:22:11.47,Default,SHA-MING,0,0,0,,Man, what the hell is this endin'?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.47,0:22:13.16,Default,SHA-MING,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm done.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.16,0:22:17.10,Default,SHA-MING,0,0,0,,I'm goin' into cold sleep, \Nso don'tcha dare wake me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.76,0:22:20.57,Default,YURI,0,0,0,,I guess things like this happen, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.57,0:22:21.11,Default,SHA-MING,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.93,0:22:24.54,Default,SHA-MING,0,0,0,,Then I'm even more sure it exists somewhere...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.13,0:22:28.56,Default,SHA-MING,0,0,0,,A world line where everyone is happy.

